---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const chapters = [
  { number: '01', word: '连接', english: 'CONNECT', title: '先让一只 Bot 上线。', copy: '准备组件、创建实例、完成登录。从本机到远端，每一步都有文档可循。', href: 'first-bot/', link: '创建第一个 Bot', shape: 'orbit' },
  { number: '02', word: '创造', english: 'CREATE', title: '再给想法一个舞台。', copy: '连接 Karin、NoneBot2、AstrBot 等应用端。插件、模型与配置，在同一个窗口管理。', href: 'apps/', link: '探索应用端', shape: 'bloom' },
  { number: '03', word: '从容', english: 'ENJOY', title: '把日常，留在一个窗口。', copy: '聊天、截图、查看日志与调试接口。从灵感到日常，不必在工具之间来回切换。', href: 'overview/', link: '认识你的工作台', shape: 'steps' },
];
---
<section id="story" class="workflow-story" aria-labelledby="story-title">
  <div class="story-stage">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="story-heading">
        <div><p class="editorial-label">THE WAY IT ALL CONNECTS</p><h2 id="story-title">一个窗口。<br /><span>许多种可能。</span></h2></div>
        <div class="story-aside"><p>让工具各就其位，<br />让你专注想做的事。</p><span class="story-pagination" aria-hidden="true"><b data-story-current>01</b><span> / 03</span></span></div>
      </header>
      <div class="story-viewport">
        <div class="story-track">
          {chapters.map((chapter) => (
            <article class={`story-card story-card-${chapter.shape}`}>
              <div class="story-card-top"><span>{chapter.number} / {chapter.english}</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div>
              <div class="story-card-art" aria-hidden="true">
                <span class="story-word">{chapter.word}</span>
                <svg class={`story-shape shape-${chapter.shape}`} viewBox="0 0 200 200" fill="none">
                  {chapter.shape === 'orbit' && <><ellipse cx="100" cy="100" rx="84" ry="38" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="15" transform="rotate(-40 100 100)" /><ellipse cx="100" cy="100" rx="84" ry="38" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="15" transform="rotate(40 100 100)" /></>}
                  {chapter.shape === 'bloom' && <g fill="currentColor">{[0, 45, 90, 135].map(angle => <rect x="83" y="8" width="34" height="184" rx="17" transform={`rotate(${angle} 100 100)`} />)}</g>}
                  {chapter.shape === 'steps' && <g stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="18">{[0, 1, 2, 3].map(i => <path d={`M${20 + i * 38} 180V${142 - i * 38}h38`} />)}</g>}
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="story-card-copy"><h3>{chapter.title}</h3><p>{chapter.copy}</p><a href={`${base}docs/${chapter.href}`}>{chapter.link}<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="story-bottom"><span>从第一次启动，到每一天的得心应手。</span><div class="story-progress" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div><a href="#management">继续了解功能 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
